    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated within an exclusive development of just 34 houses, this four-bedroom detached dormer residence in White Ash offers an abundance of natural light, generous living accommodation and an excellent layout for family life, complemented by private gardens and a large cobble driveway, and facing the green at the entrance to the estate.\n\nAlthough in need of modernisation the kitchen is bright and spacious, with a large window allowing plenty of natural light into the room. A separate dining room provides additional space for family dining and entertaining, while the adjoining utility room offers useful additional storage and functionality with direct access to the side garden.\n\nTo the front of the property there is a spacious and bright reception room, featuring a fireplace and double doors opening directly onto the garden, creating an inviting and comfortable living space.\n\nThe ground floor also includes a bedroom overlooking the garden, with French doors opening directly outside to the garden. The adjoining bathroom can be conveniently accessed from both the bedroom and the main hallway, providing flexibility for use by both occupants and guests.\n\nUpstairs, the accommodation comprises of three more bedrooms, each with its own fitted wardrobes. Two of the bedrooms also feature private en-suite bathrooms, while a separate main family bathroom serves the remainder of the first-floor accommodation.\n\nExternally, the property enjoys a high degree of privacy and is not overlooked. Two side gardens, each with a separate side entrance, provide attractive and versatile outdoor space.\n\nCombining spacious accommodation with excellent privacy and an abundance of natural light, White Ash is a home that lends itself perfectly to family living. \n\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the space, setting and overall appeal of this property.\n\nSome images may have been digitally enhanced or virtually staged to illustrate the property's potential. All measurements and floor areas are approximate and have been given in good faith. Prospective purchasers should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all details and measurements through their own inspection.\n\nSummary of 1 White Ash Park\n•Exclusive development of just 34 houses \n•Detached dormer residence \n•4 bedrooms \n•4 bathrooms \n•Built in 2005\n•210.73 m2\n•Bright and spacious kitchen with dining space \n•Separate dining room \n•Utility/laundry room \n•Spacious reception room with fireplace \n•Skylights providing excellent natural light \n•Ground-floor bedroom with garden outlook \n•Two side gardens with separate entrances \n•Large cobble driveway \n•Very private and not overlooked\n"
      },
